---
layout: base.njk
lang: en
alt: /tr/ses/
permalink: /en/sound/
title: "Sound — Pist Studio"
description: "Music production, sound design, mixing and mastering. Project-based work for independent artists and brands."
---
<section class="section" style="border-top:none">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Sound</p>
      <h1>Sound is what brought us here.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Pist started in 2020 as a music idea. The Maslak studio closed in 2026, but <strong>the work didn't stop</strong> — it changed shape.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">What we do</p>
      <h2>Three crafts, one discipline.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="hizmetler">
      {%- for is in isler %}
      <a class="hizmet hizmet-bag" href="{{ is.en.url }}" style="--hue:{{ is.hue }}">
        <span class="hizmet-cizim" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="{{ is.gorsel }}" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        </span>
        <span class="no">{{ "0" + (loop.index | string) }}</span>
        <h3>{{ is.en.ad }}</h3>
        <p>{{ is.en.ozet }}</p>
        <span class="hizmet-git">{{ i18n.en.isKarti }} →</span>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Catalogue</p>
      <h2>Released work</h2>
      <p class="lede">The list is pulled from Spotify at build time. No embedded player — nothing on this page calls Spotify from your browser.</p>
    </div>

    {%- if katalog.parcalar and katalog.parcalar.length %}
    <div class="katalog">
      {%- for p in katalog.parcalar %}
      <a class="satir katalog-satir" href="{{ p.baglanti }}" rel="noopener">
        <span class="no">{{ loop.index | ikiHane }}</span>
        <span class="ad">{{ p.ad }}</span>
        <span class="sanatci">{{ p.sanatcilar }}</span>
        <span class="yil">{{ p.yil }}</span>
        <span class="sure">{{ p.sure }}</span>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="tech" style="margin-top:18px">{{ katalog.parcalar.length }} tracks · updated {{ katalog.guncelleme }}</p>
    {%- else %}
    <div class="katalog-bos">
      <p><strong>The catalogue is not connected yet.</strong> Once the Spotify keys are in place the list will appear here in our own design. We are not filling it with invented track names.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-s" href="{{ site.social.spotify }}" rel="noopener">Listen on Spotify for now</a>
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h3>We do not rent studio time by the hour.</h3>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:14px">We work project-based with independent artists, creative teams and brands.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-p" style="margin-top:26px" href="/en/contact/">Let's talk about a project</a>
  </div>
</section>
